OL,5,G1500 Sofi Jeannin - Singing Together
OL,6,     FConductor Sofi Jeannin explores
OL,7,     Fthe fascination for composers of
OL,8,     Fchildren's voices in music as they
OL,9,     Fevolve from expressing innocence
OL,10,     Fand good to a broader palette.
OL,11,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,12,     FAlyn Shipton features music from
OL,13,     Fsaxophonists Binker Golding and
OL,14,     FSonny Rollins, and we remember the
OL,15,     Flate clarinettist Chris Walker.
OL,16,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,17,     FHannah French presents a concert
OL,18,     Fgiven by the young French vocal
OL,19,     Fensemble Contre le Temps at the
OL,20,     FNational Centre for Early Music as
OL,21,     Fpart of the 2026 York Early Music
OL,22,     FFestival.
